## 5. Long-running work

Use tmux-backed sessions (`session_create` over MCP, or `tmux -L headmesh`) or
`process_start` for anything that should outlive your connection. Sessions report
`running`, `exited(code)` or `lost` (container restarted) when you reconnect.
